  initialDialog:
  - "Well met, traveler.  I\u2019ve a task for you."
  - "Deep in the old forest lurk bristling beasts\u2014and inside each one is the
    fabled White Crystal."
  - That crystal pulses with healing light. We need one to save our wounded healer
  - Slay a forest monster, carve the crystal from its body, and bring it back to
    me.
  acceptOption: "nderstood. I\u2019ll retrieve a White Crystal from the beasts"
  acceptAnswer: "Well said. Be wary\u2014the creatures bite fierce and the crystal
    lies within their flesh."
  declineOption: "I\u2019m not up for that hunt."
  declineAnswer: "I see. Return when you\u2019ve steel in your heart."
  comebackAfterDecline: "Changed your mind? The monsters won\u2019t wait forever."
  comebackInProgress: "Have you extracted the White Crystal yet? Remember\u2014it\u2019s
    inside their bodies."
  comebackCompleted: Ah, you have the crystal! I see its glow even now.
  finalWords: "You\u2019ve done a great service. With this crystal, our healer will
    live."
